---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="The OH Moments story, vision, mission, values and customer promise — Johannesburg." path="/about" image="/img/real/hero.jpg">
<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pt-14 pb-8">
<p class="eyebrow text-[#69727D]">Our story</p>
<h1 class="display mt-2 font-semibold">About OH Moments</h1>
<div class="gold-rule my-6" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed">OH Moments is a South African lifestyle and home-essentials brand created around one powerful belief: beautiful details have the ability to transform everyday living. We carefully source and curate products that help people create homes that feel considered, tables that feel special and moments that are worth remembering.</p>
<p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">Our business brings complementary home and lifestyle offerings together under one distinctive identity. From window décor and elegant tableware to florals and household care, OH Moments is built to make beautiful living more accessible, practical and personal.</p>
<blockquote class="my-8 rounded-3xl border border-[#D9C9A5] bg-[#F5F0E6] p-8 text-center">
<p class="serif text-2xl italic text-[#12284A]">“Beautifully sourced products. Thoughtfully curated experiences. Moments made memorable.”</p>
</blockquote>
</section>
<section class="bg-[#F5F0E6] border-y border-[#D9C9A5]">
<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-12 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
<div class="rounded-3xl border border-[#D9C9A5] bg-white p-7"><p class="eyebrow text-[#69727D]">Our vision</p><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">To grow into a trusted South African lifestyle brand recognised for beautiful products, thoughtful sourcing, distinctive presentation and exceptional customer experiences.</p></div>
<div class="rounded-3xl border border-[#D9C9A5] bg-white p-7"><p class="eyebrow text-[#69727D]">Our mission</p><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">To make beautifully curated home and lifestyle products accessible by combining quality, style, value, reliable sourcing and personal service.</p></div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-12">
<p class="eyebrow text-[#69727D]">Values and promise</p>
<h2 class="h2 mt-2 font-semibold">What we stand by</h2>
<div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#D9C9A5] p-5"><h3 class="serif text-xl font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.05em]">Quality</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm">Thoughtfully selected products with value, finish and practicality in mind.</p></div>
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#D9C9A5] p-5"><h3 class="serif text-xl font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.05em]">Beauty</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm">Details that elevate spaces, tables and occasions.</p></div>
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#D9C9A5] p-5"><h3 class="serif text-xl font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.05em]">Reliability</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm">Clear communication and dependable service.</p></div>
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#D9C9A5] p-5"><h3 class="serif text-xl font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.05em]">Creativity</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm">Fresh ideas that help customers create their own moments.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="mt-8 rounded-3xl bg-[#12284A] p-8 text-white">
<p class="eyebrow text-[#D9C9A5]">Customer promise</p>
<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-white/95">At OH Moments, we believe a product should do more than meet a need — it should add something to the experience. Whether a customer is refreshing a room, setting a table, choosing a gift or caring for their home, we aim to make the journey simple, personal and beautifully considered.</p>
<p class="serif mt-4 text-xl italic text-[#D9C9A5]">OH Moments — making the everyday feel worth remembering.</p>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
